      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani ghwadeas gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba bughalaji ang'wan ea sis damanda riteawa ng'eanyiida Misri fuga sean bea Israeli, gweaydeaba ang'wan ambali Sulemani fuga Israeli, gheata sheeda siguura Sifu, was sheedeaba iyeenya, ghoang'eat ghwadeas gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheeda deeksa Sulemaneeda was sugoocheanda NG'UTAMIIDA gaba geatin laadam aba geawunda ea geatin diktam aba wiilooda, ea geatin diktam ea damanamughuush aba geawunda gal humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak bugusta gheeda heeda was madeeda gheeda gaba geatin diktam aba geawunda, gooyang'deay sea geawunda wiilooda, ea geatin damanamughuush madeeda gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasissa gheeda seawuutka sisna beehajeega miyaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadeas ghamarda jea gwaneaweesa ghamarda gheeda, ng'eanyiida sean gidang'eada bugusta ea ghooriida mida jih ea ghabwaashaada jeesinga ghoorajeega mida gah; nea gooneaweesa ghoorajeega meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heeda duukusa ng'eanyi gaba geatin muut aba murdajeega, aba bugusta gaba geatin lah aba meatkwajeega, aba geedeaba samwagu gaba geatin ispwa aba wiilooda; ak aba heeda duukusa jarooda ghwasuuy ghamarda gideaba adiidu gaguuy daranajeega sea ghamarda gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda sideas gheeda, geadeasa lagheanga goola eegul; ak ea meayiinya ghuuta yundu ghana joomooda ghana gil nuut was gharinyeanda aba jeeda gheeda sibatiisa ASEETA gheata sideasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gidaghuuta bea gheeda duukusa ng'eanyi gwanda meatkweeda duukusa wiilooda ng'eanyiida bea heeda biyeara bea gheeda; inyeesa siida ghabeawa uhuuda gidingeanda ea ghwahita geeda mida bugusta, ea gidang'eada geeda mida bugusta ea ghwahita geedeaba samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwadeas gheeda, ea ghoahiit; ak uhuuda gheeda ghwayiin ng'udanga ea beehajeega gubooyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwadeas geal manang'i aba murdajeega gheeda sean, gilba geah gaba geatin muut aba geawunda gal humng'eeda, geeroondooschi sea gheeda bea ng'udanga gubooyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba ng'asheegeaba gheawi ideasiin, inyas gajang'waanya jeeda diigheanyeekeasu, ak gisisi mureeda deaweedajeegeasu nea giing'waanyi diigheanyeekeasu atamanamughuush ak ghoabeawi jeenyaawa, abeeda gaydaahang'waay ng'asheandeanyu aba headaang'u, ghayi earukusi Dawdeeda was ghweandaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeabiida bugusta diibiga Israeli, ak ea maygwaroosean fugeasu was Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwadeas Sulemani gheeda, ea ghoahiit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giitareerda jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwadeeksa jih ghamarda gubooyeeka, ghang'eada ng'eanyi ea ghwahita uhuuda ng'udanga, ak gawiilsa geediga aba jih, aba ng'ata gawiilsa ng'eanyi jeeda gheeda beehajeega geeta mareambiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadeas meatkwajeega bwadaw bea gheeda geatin diktam aba beehajeega gubooyeanda gidang'eada ng'eanyi ea ghwahita ng'udanga, ak hean ghwadeas geeda aba jih heeda wagiida, ghoah heeda ghaydit muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gheeda, heeda bugusta gheeda was madeeda heeda wagiida gaba geatin haradam bea geawunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gubooyeanda mida jeeda gheeda geesissa suulga uurji gea ghadeeda ea deakghweeda; ak gwaduk heeda sean geeta gubooyeanda mudu ghwadaajiit lagheanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasina geeda wagiida aba jih bugusta gheeda heeda jea eayiin sandakwajeanda Neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heeda wagiida bea jih gaba geatin diktam aba geawunda ea geatin diktam aba wiilooda, ea geatin diktam aba geawunda gal humng'eeda; ak ghamuuwa dahaabu. Ak gicha ghwadeas heeda wagiida aba beehajeega gubooyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamuuw Sulemani jeeda gheeda sean aba lagheanga dahaabu, ak ghwalach aba surumga, gheeda mida jih was dea wagiida ak ghamuuw aba dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamuuw gheeda sean aba dahaabu, bwak ea googuul gheeda sean. Ak eara heeda wagiida was bugusta gheeda ghaydit muuchi ghamuuw aba dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasissa heeda wagiida was bugusta gheeda heeda ghaydit muuchi diyean iyeenya bea dabiniga, sina geediga saytuunajeega, gaba nih bea geatin damanamughuush aba geawunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geawunyeeka dabiniga meang'eega gaba geatin muut aba gilinyoo ea diyeayda gil; ak gida ng'eada meang'eanagi ea gagul niirja gaba geatin damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba niirja gaba geatin damanamughuush, iyeenye nyaawa gooyang'deay nea gawuurji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geawunda gal humng'eeda bea diyeanyagi bea dabiniga geegala geatin damanamughuush, gawuurji sea diyeaydeaba iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayiin diyeanga dabiniga bugusta gheeda; ak meang'eega nyaawa geataarda bwak ea ghwahita heeda ghamarda meang'eedeaba diyeanyagi ak meang'eedeaba diyeayda niirja ghwahita heeda ghamarda nuut; ak meang'eega nyaawa suuk gwaroonyeesa bugusta gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamuuwa diyeanga dabiniga aba dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasissa suulga ghamarda sean neaweesa gheeda aba suulga uurji diyeanga dabiniga ea miilayga ea deakghweeda nibargiidi, jeeda ghoorajeega duukusa gah ea gea duukusa jarooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamuuwa dahaabu heeda was ng'eanyi bea gah ea gea mida meatkweeda duukusa jarooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gidaghuuta jea gawa gicha gwasin gidaghuuta heeda wagiida mida bugusta gheeda aba beehajeega geeta saytuunajeega, nea uhuuda ghamarda gidaghuuta gwandeawa meadaji muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghuusi iyeenya bea saytuunajeega gwasin aba seareeda geeruubajeanda, ea miilayga ea deakghweeda, aba ng'ata goonoorsa dahaabu, ak ghwayeasha dahaabu badayda geeruubajeanda ea miilayga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta gicha gwasin ng'udanga gidaghuuta bea geeda duukusa hawunda aba beehiida geeta miilayga, nea sinitaanyi gaba meadaji ang'wan ayang'deayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea beehaji iyeenya bea mareambiida; ak geedi iyeenya bea gidaghuudagi ghwanoas gea simughut, ak geedi iyeenya bea gidaghuuta niirja eara saawa ea simughut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gang'oorsa badayda geeruubajeanda ea miilayga ea deakghweeda; ak ghwayeasha dahaabu eara heeda mida ng'ooruutka sing'oora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadeas gicha bugusta gheeda aba ghealoon samwagu bea lagheanga sidang'wal ea ghealoanagi bea geediga gubooyeeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba ang'wan ghoah gweayda sisin gumdooda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gheeda siguura Sifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gweaydeaba damwanagi, sheeda siguura Buli was sheesis, ghoahiit gheeda was meatkwajeagaaschi sean, ghoah gidaghayi sigasa gawuurji. Hean ghwadeas aba jeemba gweanyeew ispwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
